      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OLD HABITS (2) had the drop on the lead and went on to be beaten 2 lengths into second (25.89) at Shepparton in a Grade 5 over 450m. Winning claims. ROADS END (7) drifted back settling but did best work late to finish 5th at this track over 400m (23.35). Should be in this for a long way. GALLOPING JESSIE (5) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by a nose at Traralgon in a handy 24.57 beating Kenzie Kid. Winner at her latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. FISHY BUSINESS (1) cannot be dismissed although new to this venue.",
